{"id":1831458,"retrievedAt":"2026-11-20T19:22:43.256Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"https://vimeo.com/1000868972?fl=pl&fe=sh","id":1831458,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"The Vortex We Made When We Fell, or so the story goes","overview":"A couple lives in a haunted house and is visited by a priest who attempts to exorcise the home. I provided performers with costumes, a location and a prompt. We subjected cliches to reality and saw what happens when real people do their best to negotiate an unfamiliar circumstance. The house played an important role as it represented an iconic cliche and a part of the colonial imaginary. The house itself became the exercise in memory I attempted to tell through the story. An eternal recurrence, a recycling of memory with no end or definite beginning and no concrete reality.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/da0nguvAtlval1c7R7MEHRlRMkM.jpg","production_companies":[],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"","revenue":0,"runtime":12,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[{"english_name":"English","iso_639_1":"en","name":"English"}],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"The Vortex We Made When We Fell, or so the story goes","video":true,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6685261,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Res Julian","original_name":"Res Julian","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":2,"character":"Ghost","credit_id":"6aff997e21b4351ebdfda017","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6685262,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Noah Pica","original_name":"Noah Pica","popularity":0,"profile_path":null,"cast_id":3,"character":"Priest","credit_id":"6aff99899ef94228b81a2a73","order":1},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":6685264,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Hannah Doucet","original_name":"Hannah Dou